empirical idle classification, gathered on non-timing iterations to avoid profiler perturbation); the analysis plan (primary threshold test, paired Wilcoxon vs 1F1B, attribution decomposition, sensitivity curves, scheduler-vs-empirical validation); and a feasibility/budget section with a pinned software stack and a formula for total runs contingent on the final budget. Clearly mark every item as proposed default vs verified fact, state that no experiment was run, and list the assumptions/uncertainties section. Do not extend the conversation further after delivering the complete design.", "required_handoff_stage": "result", "approach_approved": true}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null, "reasoning_content": null, "thinking_blocks": [], "responses_reasoning_item": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "activated_skills": [], "extended_content": [], "sender": null, "critic_result": null, "kind": "MessageEvent"}
